<p>Hi <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>

<p>
  We are informing you that your verified character <strong><%= link_to "#{@character.name} @ #{@character.home_world}", @character.lodestone_url %></strong> was claimed by another user. If this was expected, you may disregard this e-mail.
</p>

<p>
  If this was not expected, this may indicate that your Square Enix account was accessed by someone else. You will need
  to reverify your character from the <%= link_to "XIVAuth Character Management", character_registrations_url %> page.
  Additionally, please consider the following security actions:
</p>

<ul>
  <li>Change your Square Enix account password.</li>
  <li>Enable two-factor authentication on your Square Enix and XIVAuth accounts.</li>
  <li>Change the passwords on any other sites that reuse your Square Enix password to something unique.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  If you have any questions about this notification, feel free to
  <a href="mailto:xivauth@wolf.dev">email Kaz directly</a> or ping <code>@kazwolfe</code> in the
  <a href="<%= discord_url %>">XIVAuth Discord</a> server.
</p>

<p>Thanks,
  <br>XIVAuth User Management Service</p>
